  "scope": "One exact pinned terminfo.dev@4.0.0 case, extensions.kitty-graphics.animation. Both pinned callbacks (termless and terminal) are replayed from the retained pinned bundle and are always inconclusive. One separately identified effect contract composes the owned Kitty animation carrier: a retained 16x16 raw RGBA image with three solid frames held 5 s each, a stationary control, playback, loop and stop-freeze, over paired original offscreen PNGs, complete cell/mode reads, fresh raw fences and retained wall-clock brackets. Protocol acknowledgement and painted pixels are separate facts, and elapsed time is the App's own monotonic clock observed on a real desktop, not a synthetic presentation time. One image size, one gap length and the production frame subset only: no frame-rate or display-refresh cadence, PNG frames, root-frame composition, a=c, snapshot/persistent-session replay, remote/mux, other platforms, common-harness or stock-score claim.",
